  "bio": "Cooper is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in San Diego, United States, who specializes in neotraditional and floral styles. With an obsession for quality, he uses a unique modern approach and bulletproof method in his tattooing, ensuring vibrant and long-lasting artistry that withstands over 30 years.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: San Diego, California, United States"
